    "id": "features/documentation/README.md",
    "sourcePath": "features/documentation/README.md",
    "category": "documentation",
    "title": "In-app documentation features",
    "body": "# In-app documentation features\n\n- [In-app documentation browser](in-app-documentation-browser.md) — bundled\n  feature articles, local Markdown rendering, article navigation, and a\n  bounded plain-text or regex search.\n\nThe browser is separate from the GitHub Pages site: its articles ship inside\nthe Windows application and remain available when the user is offline.\n"
